lf-contract 0.1
# A deliberately wrong contract: an exclusive interval. The word includes
# both bounds, so a value equal to a bound refutes it.
id lf-in-range/wrong-exclusive
word lf-in-range
ir tests/program/ir/examples.ir
stack ( value lower upper -- flag true | false )
inputs value lower upper
statement Wrong on purpose: claims the flag is true exactly when l < v < u.
case lower > upper
  out false
case lower <= upper
  out f true
  ensure f = flag(lower < value && value < upper)
expect refuted
